      <description><![CDATA[<p>When a source can't be reached, the library now says which one, how many skills it affects, and when Skillori asks again, and after an update it says the update went through. An update now asks only its own skills' source, and Skillori remembers GitHub's answers across restarts, so it is asked to wait far less often.</p>]]></description>
